      "side": 1,
      "message": "yes, this can happen and this is what\u0027s the bug for.\n\n`inspect` just inspect the signature but not guarantee the argument has the value.\n\nfor example, the method as this,\n@validated(\u0027entity\u0027)\ndef do_something(entity):\n pass\n \n`inspect` could help to get the signature as this,\nArgSpec(args\u003d[\u0027entity\u0027], varargs\u003dNone, keywords\u003dNone, defaults\u003dNone)\n\nbut whether there is a value for the argument \"entity\" is not depend on the signature but how this method was called.\n\npls see the testcase, it will be more clear.",
